  "notes": "No official cause code assigned in FORM-366 fields (TBD/provisional) despite narrative clearly identifying a loose LS-9 appliance lug as direct cause; category left provisional per rule 4. RPS loss and PCIS Group 2/3/6 actuation explicitly stated as NOT a specified system actuation -- only EDG start qualifies as the specified system actuation reported under 50.73(a)(2)(iv)(A); modeled RPS/PCIS as involved systems affected by the event but not as the reportable actuation itself. Two previous similar LERs captured as stub nodes with keys exactly as stated in text (50-296/2024-002-00 and 50-296/2020-001-00), referencing BFN Unit 3 (docket 50-296), distinct from this event's Unit 1/2 docket 05000259."
